## Channel picture (locked)

- **Story first.** Discovery / science story is the main picture.
- Style: **3D cartoon** (feature-animation polish). Upbeat. Not photoreal dread essay.
- **Orbit robot is retired** for this channel. Do not ship orange Orbit as the HOS mascot.

## Explorer — side character only

Working name: **the Explorer** (Victorian-scholar boy · teal coat · gold glasses · satchel · atom pin).

1. Appear **every few scenes** (about every 3–5), not continuously.
2. When present: walk through the scene · show interest · interact with 1–2 props · react (curious / think / surprise / eureka) · leave.
3. Never dominate a whole VO block as a talking-head substitute.
4. Exactly **one** Explorer in frame. No twins / clones / reflections.
5. Identity lock: messy brown hair · round gold glasses · teal overcoat · tan vest · brown bow tie · rolled trousers · brown boots · satchel + compass + map · blue “IDEAS OBSERVE QUESTION DISCOVER” book when the beat needs it.

## Hard rejects

- Orbit orange robot in a HOS film
- Explorer in every cut / stuck centre-frame all minute
- Off-model redesign (no glasses, wrong coat, adult, flat 2D cel when episode is 3D cartoon)
- Second face / dual body
- Readable logos/UI except the locked book title

